WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.945
Roborock appeared in every answer, and
ranked first in every comparative

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:08.485
response. In Recoscope's November
seventh robot-vacuum snapshot, across

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.520
ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and Perplexity,

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.640
Roborock appeared in all twelve usable
answers.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.220
Dreame appeared in eight.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.325
All four assistants ranked Roborock first
and Dreame second in the

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.440
four Ranking answers.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.740
Third place split across iRobot, Shark
and MOVA.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.205
Yet Discovery recommendations differed.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:30.620
ChatGPT named the Dreame L60 Ultra
PE.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.120
Claude named Roborock Saros 20.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.360
Gemini named Roborock Qrevo Curv or
Edge.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.460
Perplexity named the MOVA P50 Pro
Ultra.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.780
That's the distinction:

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.165
agreement on a brand ranking can still
produce different product

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:44.860
recommendations.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.725
For brands, track how often you appear,
where you rank and

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.360
which exact models get named.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.540
These captured answers do not establish
product quality.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.400
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
